    {
      "id": "GsoR414AIiYCT20wNQ1lL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2995.6186443379024,
      "y": 2331.4945522129924,
      "width": 1228.433349609375,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 150457241,
      "version": 296,
      "versionNonce": 233514359,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774467800429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Si tuvieramos x1, x2, x3, x4 y solo x1,x2 cumplen P(x) entonces:\n\nf(x1) * [P(x1)] + f(x2) * [P(x2)] + f(x3) * [P(x3)] + f(x4) * [P(x4)]\n\n{Como solo x1 y x2 cumplen P(x)}\n\nf(x1) * 1 + f(x2) * 1 + f(x3) * 0 + f(x4) * 0\n\nf(x1) + f(x2)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Si tuvieramos x1, x2, x3, x4 y solo x1,x2 cumplen P(x) entonces:\n\nf(x1) * [P(x1)] + f(x2) * [P(x2)] + f(x3) * [P(x3)] + f(x4) * [P(x4)]\n\n{Como solo x1 y x2 cumplen P(x)}\n\nf(x1) * 1 + f(x2) * 1 + f(x3) * 0 + f(x4) * 0\n\nf(x1) + f(x2)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
