    {
      "id": "H_79MqjZ12Wb9TUZO4iKB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3085.7745602048685,
      "y": 5678.394550455155,
      "width": 1240.199951171875,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 463427447,
      "version": 343,
      "versionNonce": 926420759,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "mNz6ThXndStvs1gW2PGc6",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1774476116803,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dada una Network (V,E,c) y un par de vértices s,t en V, definimos flujo\nde s a t como una función f : E -> ℝ cuyas propiedades son:\n    \n    1) 0 <= f(xy) <= c(xy)      ∀ xy ∈ E.\n    2) inf(x) = outf(x)           ∀ x ∈ V - {s,t}\n    3) outf(s) >= inf(s)\n    4) inf(t) >= outf(t)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dada una Network (V,E,c) y un par de vértices s,t en V, definimos flujo\nde s a t como una función f : E -> ℝ cuyas propiedades son:\n    \n    1) 0 <= f(xy) <= c(xy)      ∀ xy ∈ E.\n    2) inf(x) = outf(x)           ∀ x ∈ V - {s,t}\n    3) outf(s) >= inf(s)\n    4) inf(t) >= outf(t)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
